        <activityName xml:lang="en">Phosphate rock mine</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Phosphate rock mine
Large uncertainties for equipment used due to weak data from only 2 mines and various assumtions.;
UUID: 890b4e7b-1be8-34bc-a338-c3c5e68bfd05
Mining equipment, equipment for beneficiation, buildings for beneficiation plant, land use of processing pant.
Location: Assumption for infrastructure in U.S. based on weak data of 2 U.S. mines.
Technology: No specific technology modelled
Time period: Time of literature publication. Measurements took place partly before this period.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Estimation from literature 
Extrapolations: Extrapolation from 2 U.S. mines having together about 15% market share. Therefore representativeness set to 15%.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_890b4e7b-1be8-34bc-a338-c3c5e68bfd05.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
